{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">吉宏股份截至六月底止中期，按年多賺三成三。</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">純利1.57億元人民幣，中期息每股派0.14元人民幣。期內收入超過37億元人民幣，按年增長一成半。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-18T00:37:56.924067+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":71,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}